expressed 'deep concern' over hostilities in the Middle East. China's President Xi Jinping said the Iran war was not in the bloc's interest.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Russian GRU spies behind failed Leipzig attack: reports</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e35bfec078c46ec24669e15247c5853e77fbe4e5bf0e50a4461ef9c6eca18b5d</id><updated>2026-09-13T04:58:56Z</updated><published>2026-09-12T11:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/russian-gru-spies-behind-failed-leipzig-attack-reports/a-79244858--97143d694fa7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/russian-gru-spies-behind-failed-leipzig-attack-reports/a-79244858?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A German newspaper has cited reports tying a failed attack at Leipzig Airport to Moscow's GRU military intelligence agency. One suspect's ties to GRU were known when he entered the country, yet he was not surveilled.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Brazil: Flavio Bolsonaro faces corruption probe weeks before election</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:cb95c75de9a687e00f00743f0ab12cd2ef8fff8ef67b529ea38791901fd1a783</id><updated>2026-09-13T04:58:56Z</updated><published>2026-09-12T09:37:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/brazil-flavio-bolsonaro-faces-corruption-probe-weeks-before-election/a-79242561--f6206eb40070.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/brazil-flavio-bolsonaro-faces-corruption-probe-weeks-before-election/a-79242561?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Brazilian Senator Flavio Bolsonaro, Lula's top rival in next month's election, is under investigation for alleged corruption linked to financing a biopic about his father, former President Jair Bolsonaro.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Corals as climate archive: Are El Ninos intensifying?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b2a33157da21fc07e58ad5f394e38d9a2b412d3d5c012b8121320acac9792931</id><updated>2026-09-13T04:58:56Z</updated><published>2026-09-12T08:53:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/corals-as-climate-archive-are-el-ninos-intensifying/a-79243425--052f407fd862.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/corals-as-climate-archive-are-el-ninos-intensifying/a-79243425?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Records from the past few decades show that, during this period, El Nino events have been frequent and often extreme. But is this normal, or is it the result of climate change? Corals can give us a clear indication.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Uber leaves two key African markets — and their drivers in despair</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0a779aaec64101c867241d1c98fd38e3e5279974ab83ade98fab3c153410006a</id><updated>2026-09-13T04:58:56Z</updated><published>2026-09-12T07:56:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/uber-leaves-two-key-african-markets-and-their-drivers-in-despair/a-79232189--bdbc88dc3498.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/uber-leaves-two-key-african-markets-and-their-drivers-in-despair/a-79232189?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Uber's departure from Nigeria and Uganda has left countless customers high and dry. But what about drivers? With fuel prices, maintenance, and other operating costs rising, many say they're struggling to make a living.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>North Korea fires multiple ballistic missiles day after trilateral drills end</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2efc866caf1436fb962b8c27fa696526f84c0a9e2baea55d5d48a6bc3d2dc22f</id><updated>2026-09-13T04:58:56Z</updated><published>2026-09-12T07:15:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/north-korea-fires-multiple-ballistic-missiles-day-after-trilateral-drills-end/a-79242070--